                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Bought the game for the hell of it since it was 5 bucks - No graphics options but graphics are ok.\n\nGameplay is more like the classic duck hunter from Nintendo in the 80's. You have a time limit to kill the animals in question and are deducted points if you shoot things you shouldn't. \n\nIf that's your type of game then you will like it otherwise it won't hold your attention long.",
